  "content": {
    "prompt": "Write Python code that sets x to 6 and y to 2. If x divided by y is greater than or equal to 3, set y to y plus x, and then set x to x minus y. Otherwise, set x to 0. Print x and then print y.",
    "source_code": "x = 6\ny = 2\nif x / y >= 3:\n    y = y + x\n    x = x - y\nelse:\n    x = 0\nprint(x)\nprint(y)\n"
